version 0.15
component d-b340a

kind         part
mpn          B340A
manufacturer Diodes Incorporated
category     diode
datasheet    https://www.diodes.com/assets/Datasheets/ds30891.pdf

symbol power:d
footprint sma:sma

# The part's own rating (ADR-0026): what the device is, not what the design asks of it.
# Per the Diodes Incorporated datasheet DS30891 (B320A - B360A), Maximum Ratings: peak repetitive
# reverse voltage V_RRM 40 V for the B340A. The terminal pair names the two pins the rating is
# about: from = the anode (pin 2), to = the cathode (pin 1). A diode's reverse rating covers the
# reverse polarity only -- the forward voltage is a characteristic, not a limit (ADR-0075 D3).
ratings
  reverse_voltage  voltage  40V  2 1

pins
  1  K  passive
  2  A  passive
